2026-10-26 19:51 Decision (coordinator, on the maintainer's order to work the board off): option (a): with commit_reason_required, writing tools refuse a call without a reason, and their descriptions say so. Branch klein.

Done in 74548b3 (branch klein). Own decisions: (1) rename_page and delete_page had no reason argument and could never succeed with the option on, so both got an optional reason (commit message and event key when given); (2) the schema keeps reason out of required: the refusal is a tool result with a clear message, not a JSON-RPC -32602, so the model can act on it; (3) non-empty means visible text, as for the commit message. Writing tools = tools whose annotations are not read-only. t/60 red against the old lib.
